WEBVTT

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.480
<b>In the beginning,
there was fire.</b>

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.980
It won't...

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.490
<b>The fire mixed
with the water.</b>

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.490
It won't... end like this.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.990
<b>And it became
the firewater.</b>

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:21.560
I will not let them take from me my country.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.580
Who is there?

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:39.100
Is it you who stole the 
heart from me, the great Kentei?

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.140
Give it back!

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.520
Give back my heart!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.290
Give it back! Give back my heart!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.270
At last, I have it back!

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.410
<i>The last year of the Kan dynasty.</i>

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:36.080
<i>The authority of Emperor Kentei had fallen,</i>

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.620
<i>and he was no more than a puppet.</i>

00:01:36.990 --> 00:02:08.850
<b>Gi</b>

00:01:37.990 --> 00:02:06.560
<b>Go</b>

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:55.460
<b>Shoku</b>

00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:43.560
<i>Souhi, of the land of Gi, 
forced Kentei to abdicate,</i>

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.610
<i>and proclaimed himself emperor.</i>

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:49.920
<i>Sonken of Go, and Ryuubi of Shoku,</i>

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.300
<i>also declared themselves Emperor,</i>

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.250
<i>and China collapsed into civil war.</i>

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.650
<i>There was another secret truth 
hidden behind the chaos.</i>

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.610
<i>Chouryou, a genius who 
served the Kan dynasty,</i>

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:10.640
<i>invented the spell of Kankongyakuten to 
ensure the dynasty's eternal prosperity.</i>

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:15.440
<i>This spell involved a circle drawn 
in the blood of the royal family,</i>

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.780
<i>and nine shrines controlled by 
the Emperor's closest aides.</i>

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.830
<i>It had the power to alter history itself.</i>

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.040
<i>Fortunately, the betrayal 
of some of these aides</i>

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.170
<i>stopped this terrifying 
situation from coming to pass.</i>

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.790
<i>But...</i>

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:36.460
<i>It was only the beginning 
of a long, bloody battle.</i>

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.190
<i>Powers desiring the return 
of the Kan dynasty battled</i>

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.090
<i>a faction desperate to stop them</i>

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:45.060
<i>in a battle where they 
devoured each others souls.</i>

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:47.620
<i>People called it thus:</i>

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:55.020
<b>Soul Buster</b>

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.240
<i>Soul Buster.</i>

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.760
Huh? A dream?

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.040
Oh, you're finally up.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.250
Sensei?

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.100
What am I doing here?

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.230
You passed out in class

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:15.860
and someone brought you here.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.090
It sounded like you were having a bad dream.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.060
Well? How do you feel?

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:23.100
I had a strange dream...

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.600
Okay, that does it.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.260
That's strange.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.600
Did you cut yourself on the metal on the bed?

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:36.930
Anyway, Chou-sensei was 
laughing and saying that

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:42.370
if you passed out in the middle of class,
you must really hate history!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.480
That's not it.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:46.620
But is there any point in studying history?

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.720
What happened a thousand
years ago doesn't matter.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:56.880
I think there's more important 
things to spend your youth on.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.630
Wait, you're not listening!

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.880
You done already?

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:03.990
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:08.970
I'm not really good at helping 
loud teenagers with their problems.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:13.030
I'm saying that history books 
aren't good for anything.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:17.230
Glad it looks like you're 
doing better, Sonshin-kun.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.540
C-Chou-sensei!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:23.090
I left your homework for 
today in the classroom.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.740
It's due tomorrow.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.740
Work hard to make up for lost time, okay?

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.500
All of this?

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.000
Hey, Ryouun,

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.560
today's class..

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.640
Take care.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:38.750
Man, she's cold.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.180
I'm never gonna finish this.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.770
History, huh?

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.690
He called himself Kentei, didn't he?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.330
This one?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:02.840
And this one?

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:04.950
Wait, and this one too?

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.440
Why is there nothing in here about the

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.340
<i>Romance of the Three Kingdoms</i> period?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.950
<b>Shunjuu High</b>

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.950
Shunjuu High?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.930
Isn't the name of our school?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.480
Wait, wait, wait!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.410
Where am I?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.100
Is someone there?

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.160
Excellent.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.910
Watch out! A zashiki warashi!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.080
A zashiki warashi? How rude.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.920
I am the famous Suikyou-sensei.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.420
W-W-W-W...

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.020
Weird eyebrows!

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.170
Don't you have anything else to say?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.310
Where am I?

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.430
Am I dreaming again?

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:15.440
The cards will answer your question.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.190
What's this?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.150
I am just a guide.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:38.550
It is you yourself who will see the future.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.930
What was that mummy monster?

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:45.960
And if it was a dream,
why do I have a cut on my hand?

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:50.470
It's not your first time 
having that dream, is it?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.220
How did you know?

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:54.690
Excellent.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.980
If you want the answer, draw a card.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.230
This looks fun.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.990
A warning, first.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.480
What?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.580
From the moment you draw the card,

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.980
you'll become a participant 
in a very interesting game.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.000
It's very simple.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.000
You just have to make sure you 
never lose the card you draw.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:26.250
Do you swear to defend 
that card with your life?

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.600
Yeah, got it.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.530
I swear.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.940
This is interesting indeed!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.960
Is this fate?

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.450
Wait!

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.950
You haven't told me anything yet!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:08:00.450
The card you choose will 
lead you to the answer.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.310
If you're lucky, that is.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:05.590
That wasn't the deal!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:08.090
Make sure you don't lose it.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.340
Huh?

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:18.140
What's the deal with today?

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.100
What's going on?

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.520
Staying late to do your homework?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.600
Glad to see it.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.160
Sensei...

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:30.360
But you really must take 
better care of the books.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.920
I've got bigger problems!

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:34.430
Look at this.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.600
None of the books say

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.780
anything about the <i>Romance 
of the Three Kingdoms</i> period.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.490
Like this one!

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:43.960
And this weird thing just 
showed up and gave me a card.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.730
So I was right, and it's 
you too, then, Sonshin-kun?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:52.730
Let us start the game, then.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:58.220
It's in your best interests 
to just give me the card.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.760
Sensei, what do you mean?

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.150
Do you swear to defend 
that card with your life?

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.980
What's wrong, Sonshin-kun?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.360
Now, give me the card.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.490
I'm sorry.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.240
What exactly are those cards?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.920
Do they have something to do with me?

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.460
Give it to me, now!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.460
I won't let you get away!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.230
Y-You're kidding, right?

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.730
I am not.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.730
Gien, kill him.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.730
Understood.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.060
You were right.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:01.480
History books didn't help you.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.880
Is this about that mirror?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:06.120
Was that mirror really that important?

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.930
It wasn't deliberate!

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:10.130
I didn't mean to break it!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.450
Mirror?

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.590
I see.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:18.670
So it was you who returned 
Emperor Kentei's heart?

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.640
Then I must thank you even more.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:34.230
How long are you going to keep hiding?

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.270
This card...

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.420
Save me...

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:53.170
This is the end!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.260
Still your tongues!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.160
Shuuyu is here!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:30.000
<b>Fin</b>

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.540
The princess descends,

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.560
the fire rises,

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.470
and the wind blows,

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.500
becoming a storm.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.090
Memories the color of twilight 
awaken the curse of the

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.440
cycle of reincarnation.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:16.270
Is the crimson sky an undying omen?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.750
Next time: "Enlightenment."
